=begin pod

So you enjoy Raku, and want to let others know about it?  There are a variety of 
ways you can do this.  

The L<marketing|https://marketing.raku.org/> site has some resources sorely in 
need of an update (talk to the L<Outreach Troupe|../troupes/outreach> to 
assist).  At this point, the only useful material is the logos, which you may be 
able to use in your efforts to share your love of Raku.  

You can also get some merch at 
L<Zazzle Raku/Rakudo Merch|https://www.zazzle.com/store/rakudo>.  

=head1 Used in Production

Sometimes it can be useful in your sharing of Raku to be able to cite places 
where Raku has been used in production.  To that end, here's a list of places 
that that has been done:

